#: includes/class-zinn-backups-promo.php:543
msgid "Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy."
msgstr "ຊື້ ແລະ ຂາຍເວັບໄຊທີ່ສ້າງຕັ້ງຂຶ້ນແລ້ວ, ໂດເມນ ແລະ ການວາງລິ້ງ, ໂດຍເງິນຈະຖືກເກັບຮັກສາໄວ້ຢ່າງປອດໄພຈົນກວ່າທັງສອງຝ່າຍຈະພໍໃຈ."

#: includes/class-zinn-backups-promo.php:590
msgid "Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living"
msgstr "Zinn Hub® — ຈ້າງຄົນທີ່ເຮັດສິ່ງນີ້ເປັນອາຊີບ"

#: includes/class-zinn-backups-promo.php:591
msgid "Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid."
msgstr "ຕະຫຼາດຟຣີແລນທົ່ວໂລກຂອງພວກເຮົາ: ເລືອກເບິ່ງຫຼາຍກວ່າ 10,000 ການບໍລິການທີ່ພ້ອມໃຊ້ງານຈາກນັກຂຽນ, ນັກອອກແບບ, ນັກພັດທະນາ ແລະ ຜູ້ຊ່ຽວຊານ SEO, ຫຼື ໂພສໂຄງການແລ້ວໃຫ້ພວກເຂົາສະເໜີລາຄາ."

#: includes/class-zinn-backups-updater.php:253
msgid "See the Zinn Digital® release notes."
msgstr "ເບິ່ງບັນທຶກການປ່ອຍ Zinn Digital®."

#: includes/class-zinn-backups-updater.php:302
msgid "The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again."
msgstr "ບໍລິການອັບເດດ Zinn® ບໍ່ໄດ້ອອກລິ້ງດາວໂຫຼດສຳລັບການອັບເດດນີ້. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າເວັບໄຊນີ້ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງແພລດຟອມ Zinn® ໄດ້ຫຼືບໍ່, ຈາກນັ້ນລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. translators: %s: the download error reported by WordPress.
#: includes/class-zinn-backups-updater.php:316
#, php-format
msgid "The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດດາວໂຫຼດການອັບເດດຈາກບໍລິການອັບເດດ Zinn® (%s) ໄດ້. ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງໃນອີກສອງສາມນາທີ."

#: includes/class-zinn-backups-updater.php:330
msgid "The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed."
msgstr "ການອັບເດດທີ່ດາວໂຫຼດມາບໍ່ຜ່ານການກວດສອບຄວາມຖືກຕ້ອງສົມບູນ ແລະ ບໍ່ໄດ້ຖືກຕິດຕັ້ງ."

#: includes/import/class-archive-reader.php:147
msgid "The zip archive could not be opened. It may be damaged or incomplete."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເປີດແຟ້ມ zip ໄດ້. ມັນອາດຈະເສຍຫາຍ ຫຼື ບໍ່ສົມບູນ."

#: includes/import/class-archive-reader.php:311
msgid "This .wpress file uses a format we cannot read (it may be compressed or encrypted by All-in-One WP Migration). Export it again without encryption."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ .wpress ນີ້ໃຊ້ຮູບແບບທີ່ພວກເຮົາບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ (ມັນອາດຈະຖືກບີບອັດ ຫຼື ເຂົ້າລະຫັດໂດຍ All-in-One WP Migration). ກະລຸນາສົ່ງອອກມັນອີກຄັ້ງໂດຍບໍ່ມີການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ."

#: includes/import/class-formats.php:66
msgid "This is a Duplicator “DupArchive” (.daf) file. In Duplicator, build the package again with the archive format set to ZIP, then import that."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ Duplicator “DupArchive” (.daf). ໃນ Duplicator, ໃຫ້ສ້າງແພັກເກດຄືນໃໝ່ໂດຍຕັ້ງຮູບແບບບ່ອນຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນເປັນ ZIP, ຈາກນັ້ນນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ."

#: includes/import/class-formats.php:69
msgid "This UpdraftPlus database backup is encrypted. Decrypt it in UpdraftPlus (or turn off database encryption and back up again), then import it."
msgstr "ການສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນຖານຂໍ້ມູນ UpdraftPlus ນີ້ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດໄວ້. ຖອດລະຫັດມັນໃນ UpdraftPlus (ຫຼື ປິດການເຂົ້າລະຫັດຖານຂໍ້ມູນແລ້ວສຳຮອງຂໍ້ມູນອີກຄັ້ງ), ຈາກນັ້ນນຳເຂົ້າ."

#: includes/import/class-formats.php:76
msgid "Database dump"
msgstr "ດຳຖານຂໍ້ມູນ"

#. translators: %s: file name.
#: includes/import/class-formats.php:93
#, php-format
msgid "%s is not a backup archive we can read (zip, tar, tar.gz, .wpress, .sql or .sql.gz)."
msgstr "%s ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ຈັດເກັບຂໍ້ມູນສຳຮອງທີ່ພວກເຮົາສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້ (zip, tar, tar.gz, .wpress, .sql ຫຼື .sql.gz)."

#: includes/import/class-formats.php:99
msgid "Website archive"
msgstr "ບ່ອນເກັບມ້ຽນເວັບໄຊ"

#. translators: %s: file name.
#: includes/import/class-formats.php:123
#, php-format
msgid "%s has no WordPress content (no wp-content folder and no database dump) in it."
msgstr "%s ບໍ່ມີເນື້ອຫາ WordPress (ບໍ່ມີໂຟນເດີ wp-content ແລະ ບໍ່ມີດາຕາເບສດັມ) ຢູ່ໃນນັ້ນ."

#: includes/import/class-formats.php:155
msgid "This .wpress file is encrypted or compressed by All-in-One WP Migration. Export it again with encryption and compression switched off, then import that."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ .wpress ນີ້ຖືກເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ຫຼື ຖືກບີບອັດໂດຍ All-in-One WP Migration. ກະລຸນາສົ່ງອອກມັນອີກຄັ້ງໂດຍປິດການເຂົ້າລະຫັດ ແລະ ການບີບອັດ, ຈາກນັ້ນນຳເຂົ້າໄຟລ໌ນັ້ນ."

#: includes/storage/class-destinations.php:62
